OL,3,ALib Dems would cut income tax, says Ed
OL,4,ADavey in conference speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey says
OL,7,Fhis party would cut income tax in a
OL,8,Fspeech to close his party's annual
OL,9,Fconference
OL,11,FHe says his party would raise the
OL,12,Ftax-free personal allowance to #15,000
OL,13,Fif it was in power and raise the higher
OL,14,Frate 40% tax band threshold to #56,000
OL,16,FTax cuts would be paid for by growing
OL,17,Fthe economy through closer ties with
OL,18,FEurope, including rejoining the EU
OL,19,Fsingle market
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
